OL,3,AEnergy bills are going up - here's what
OL,4,Ayou can do about it
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnergy prices have now risen by nearly
OL,7,F4%, with forecasts of a much bigger
OL,8,Fjump to come in January.
OL,10,FRegulator Ofgem's price cap affects
OL,11,Fabout 20 million households in England,
OL,12,FScotland and Wales and sets a maximum
OL,13,Fprice for each unit of gas and
OL,14,Felectricity.
OL,16,FForecasters have suggested a 16%
OL,17,Fincrease is possible in January, due to
OL,18,Fhigh wholesale prices paid by suppliers
OL,19,Fas a result of the conflict in the
OL,20,FMiddle East.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
